Key Lessons Learned

* Intune supports centralized application deployment and removal.
* Assignment types determine how applications are offered, installed, or removed.
* Group targeting is important when controlling which users or devices receive an application assignment.
* Successful installation on a device does not necessarily mean Intune’s reporting has updated.
* Installation detection rules and assignment configuration are important when troubleshooting deployment status.

